{"results":[{"url":"https://www.propertypistol.com/projects/ruparel-westsky-kandivali-west-pid-4720","title":"Ruparel Westsky in Kandivali West, Mumbai - PropertyPistol","raw_content":"1. [Home](/)\n2. /\n3. [Mumbai](/mumbai)\n4. /\n5. [Flats for sale in Mumbai](/mumbai/buy/flats-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n6. /\n7. [New Projects in Mumbai](/mumbai/buy/new-projects-in-mumbai)\n8. /\n9. [New Projects in Kandivali West](/mumbai/buy/real-estate-projects-in-kandivali-west)\n10. /\n11. Ruparel Westsky\n\n# Ruparel Westsky\n\nFlats by **[Ruparel Realty](/mumbai/buy/projects-by-ruparel-realty)** at Ruparel Westsky - Kandivali West, Dahanukar Wadi Road, Kandivali, Maharashtra Nagar, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India\n\nRERA\n\nP51800007630\n\nAgent RERA - A51700000043\n\nINR2.1 Cr\n\nOnwards\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nINR2.1 Cr\n\nOnwards\n\nConfigurations2 BHK\n\nPossession DateDec 2025\n\nBuilt up AreaOn request\n\nCarpet Area620\n\n* Sq.ft\n* Sq.yrd\n* Sq.mtr\n* Acres\n\nMin. Price per Sqft.INR 33.87 K per Sqft.\n\n[![Rera Kerala]()https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nP51800007630\n\nScan QR code to view RERA details","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-codename-west-park/8557/project","title":"Ruparel Codename West Park, Kandivali West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹65.03 Lac Onwards | 1, 2 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"# Ruparel Codename West Park Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Ruparel developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/ruparel-598.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n![Ruparel Codename West Park Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ruparel-codename-west-park-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-520;h-260;crop;)\n![Ruparel Codename West Park Project Thumbnail Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ruparel-code