| ₹ 26,800 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Kandivali West ranges from ₹ 24.2 K to ₹ 75.6 K with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Ruparel Codename West Park | In Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 35 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 49.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 75.6 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Ruparel Codename West Park.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Ruparel Codename West Park moved from ₹ 32,700/sqft to ₹ 34,900/sqft, reflecting a 6.73% rise.\n\n## Ruparel Codename West Park Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 1 BHK 667 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Ruparel Codename West Park, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/ruparel-codename-west-park-apartment-1bhk-667sqft-1.jpg?aio=w-278;h-200;crop;)\n\n### 1 BHK 667 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Saleable)\n\nPrice: **₹ 65.03 Lac**\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 815 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Ruparel Codename West Park, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/ruparel-codename-west-park-apartment-2bhk-815sqft-1.jpg?aio=w-278;h-200;crop;)\n\n### 2 BHK 815 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Saleable)\n\nPrice: **₹ 79.46 Lac**\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 1072 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Ruparel Codename West Park, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/ruparel-codename-west-park-apartment-2bhk-1072sqft-1.jpg?aio=w-278;h-200;crop;)\n\n### 2 BHK 1072 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Saleable)\n\nPrice: **₹ 1.05 Cr**\n\n## Resale Listings in Ruparel Codename West Park\n\nExplore resale listings currently available in Ruparel Codename West Park, Mumbai.\n\n![2 BHK + Pooja Room Apartment For Sale in Ruparel Codename West Park in Kandivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\nMumbai\n\n![Nadeem H Ishaqi]()\n\nRishan Realty\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Ruparel Codename West Park\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Ruparel Codename West Park to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Ruparel Codename West Park Master Plan 1](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ruparel-codename-west-park-master-plan-image1.jpg?aio=w-370;h-366;crop;)\n![Ruparel Codename West Park Project Thumbnail Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ruparel-codename-west-park-project-large-image1-thumb.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Ruparel Codename West Park Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ruparel-codename-west-park-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Ruparel Codename West Park Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ruparel-codename-west-park-flagshipimg1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n### Master Plan 1\n\nRuparel Codename West Park, located in Kandivali West, presents a comprehensive master plan focused on residential living amidst ample green spaces and recreational amenities. While the exact total land area, number of units, and number of towers are not explicitly detailed on this master plan overview, the layout clearly showcases a well-planned community.\n\nThe master plan for Ruparel Codename West Park is structured with a clear segregation of residential blocks and extensive open, landscaped areas. There are three distinct clusters of residential buildings integrated within the development. A substantial portion of the land is dedicated to green spaces, gardens, and shared amenities, suggesting a design that prioritizes residents' outdoor and recreational needs.\n\nDownload master plan & walkthrough video of Ruparel Codename West Park to explore layout and virtual tour in Kandivali West, Mumbai.\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Ruparel Codename West Park\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.sq