me West Park is a Ready to Move residential project, allowing buyers to take possession immediately without any construction wait.\n\n### What are the popular amenities available at Ruparel Codename West Park?\n\nResidents of Ruparel Codename West Park can enjoy amenities such as Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, High Speed Elevators, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Cafe / Coffee Bar, Dance Room, Rain Water Harvesting, Sewage Treatment Plant, designed for comfort and a modern lifestyle.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![](/assets/images/new-dotcom-services-icons/home-loan.png)\n![](/assets/images/new-dotcom-services-icons/valuation.png)\n![](/assets/images/new-dotcom-services-icons/sell-or-rent-property.png)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n![Lodha](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/lodha-521-6366.jpg)\n![Kalpataru](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/kalpataru-532-5000.jpg)\n![Hiranandani](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/hiranandani-451.jpg)\n![Runwal](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/runwal-538-4155.jpg)\n![Rustomjee](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/rustomjee-599.jpg)\n![Mayfair Housing](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mayfair-housing-585.jpg)\n![Godrej](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/godrej-49-2414.jpg)\n![Chandak](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/chandak-1050.jpg)\n![Mahindra Lifespaces](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mahindra-lifespaces-68.jpg)\n![Shapoorji Pallonji](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/shapoorji-pallonji-494.jpg)\n![Kalpataru Vian](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-vian-project-project-large-image1-5543-opt-460392f9-2d11-4a1c-b830-fba5e810b682.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![LnT Ahana](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lnt-ahana-project-project-large-image1-4621-opt-3fdf8c3f-c784-42fd-b0f5-4398c6901234.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Purva Estrella](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/purva-estrella-project-project-large-image1-3989-opt-3a6c3ad5-4526-45bf-b146-a3e451ce03ed.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Adani Linkbay Residences](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/adani-linkbay-residences-project-project-large-image1-2560.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Mahindra Marina 64](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-marina-64-project-project-large-image1-2484.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Mahindra Rainforest](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-rainforest-project-project-large-image1-5108-opt-1de55a7d-9847-4c14-bd04-8125e6d5a57d.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Runwal Meadows](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-meadows-project-project-large-image1-8749-opt-0576b543-8352-4304-ab97-6c63b05f3057.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![GHP Mars Suncity](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ghp-mars-suncity-project-project-large-image1-7362.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Runwal Bliss](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-bliss-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![LnT Elixir Reserve](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lnt-elixir-reserve-project-project-large-image1-6960.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![voice search]()\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/project/ruparel-elara-kandivali-west/18046","title":"Ruparel Elara, Borivali — resale, rent & RERA | MPE","raw_content":"[![Mumbai Property Exchange](/static/images/logo.png)](/)\n[List Property](/list-property)[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\n[New Projects](/projects-new-homes)[🗺️ Projects Map](/projects-map)[Buy a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/sale/all-locations)[Rent a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/rent/all-locations)[Commercial](/commercial-office-premises/sale/all-locations)[Builders & Developers](/builders)[Why Us](/why-us)[RERA Search](/rera-search)[Localities](/locations)[Tools & Calculators](/tools/budget-planner)[NRI Hub](/nri-hub)[News](/news)[+ List Your Property](/list-property)[💬 WhatsApp Us](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\nMumbai property advisory & dataOperating since 1995✓ MahaRERA A51800043517Source-labelled project dataWe reply in minutes on WhatsApp\n\n![Ruparel Elara](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/18046/18046-main.webp)✓ MahaRERA P51800014328RERA: no litigation reported\n\n# Ruparel Elara\n\n[Shree Siddhivinayak Infrastructure & Realty](/builder/shree-siddhivinayak-infrastructure-realty)\n\n📍 Borivali, Mumbai Suburban · 400067\n\nCertificate Signed\n\n**Completed/historical project — current inventory unconfirmed**\n\nAsk an advisor to check current resale or rental availability.\n\nSource stage: Sold Out · mapped resale: 0 · mapped rental: 0 · primary status: recorded\n\nPooja Batra · Senior Advisor\n\nMumbai Property Exchange · MahaRERA-registered since 2017\n\n[📞 Call](tel:+919819311244)[💬 WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=Hi%20MPE%2C%20I%20have%20a%20property%20query)\n\n★\n\n## Gallery\n\n![Ruparel Elara](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/18046/18046-oth-ruparel-elara-elevation-image-1.webp)![Ruparel Elara](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/18046/18046-oth-ruparel-elara-image-1.webp)![Ruparel Elara](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/18046/18046-oth-ruparel-elara-image-2.webp)![Ruparel Elara](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/18046/18046-oth-ruparel-elara-lobby.webp)![Ruparel Elara](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/18046/18046-oth-ruparel-elara-amenities.webp)![Ruparel Elara](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/18046/18046-oth-ruparel-elara-senior-citizen-longe.webp)![Ruparel Elara](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/18046/18046-oth-ruparel-elara-elegant-living-space.webp)![Ruparel Elara](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/18046/18046-oth-ruparel-elara-location-map.webp)![Ruparel Elara](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/18046/18046-oth-ruparel-elara-location-connectivity.webp)![Ruparel Elara](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/18046/18046-oth-ruparel-elara-typical-floor-plan.webp)![Ruparel Elara](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/18046/18046-oth-ruparel-elara-unit-flat-no-1.webp)![Ruparel Elara](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/18046/18046-oth-ruparel-elara-unit-flat-no-2-3.webp)\n\ni\n\n## Overview\n\nRuparel Elara is located in the heart of Kandivali west and is developed by Ruparel Realty. Highlights of Ruparel Elara: A Marvellous 22 Storeyed High-Rise Tower Conveniently Located at Kandivali West Offering 1 BHK Enriched Lifestyle Homes Smartly Planned Living Spaces with World-Class Fixtures & Fitments Elegant Lifestyle Amenities on Terrace Level Ruparel Elara was launched in Oct 2014 and the possession of the same is likely to be in Dec 2019. Stack Car Parking Space Ruparel Elara is RERA approved has the Registration Number bearing P51800014328. Ruparel Realty also has other under construction and ready possession and sold out projects like Shanti Aashish, The Ridge, Sea Winds, Ruparel Orion, Ruparel Ariana, Ruparel Iris, Ruparel Sea Palace, Ruparel Mirage, Ruparel Sky Greens, Ruparel Jewel, Codename West Park, Ruparel Elara , Ruparel Elavia, Ruparel Regalia, Ruparel Optima, Ruparel Palacio, Ruparel Sky Greens, Ruparel Nova, Ruparel Pride. The property prices in Kandivali West are in the range of 13000 to 17500 for Outright for ready and under construction projects. Ruparel Realty currently has 6 Under Construction projects. Ruparel Elara has good reviews and the ratings of this project are approximately 4 out of 5.\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n₹32,407\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹40,000**\n\n19% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Kandivali West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹25,373/sqft\n\nmedian · 34 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹75.8/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹60,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.6%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹32,407/sqft** — **28% above** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nDec 2019\n\nRevised\n\nDec 2019\n\nStatus\n\nOngoing\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n1 BHK426–432 ft²₹1.38 Cr–₹1.4 Cr\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price = locality rate × carpet (not the developer's quote).\n\n[💬 Verify current inventory with an advisor](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Ruparel%20Elara%20(RERA%20P51800014328))\n\n03\n\n## RERA Trust Record\n\nMahaRERA No.\n\nP51800014328\n\nRegistered\n\n2021-05-24\n\nLitigation\n\nNo reported in source\n\nEscrow Bank\n\nKOTAK MAHINDRA BANK LIMITED\n\nArchitect\n\nRahul Kamathi\n\nTotal FSI\n\n3818\n\n04\n\n## Buildings · 1 Wing(s)\n\nRuparel Elara24 floors · — units\n\n05\n\n## Land DNA · Genesis\n\n**Redevelopment / SRA / MHADA / MMRDA / Freehold** — provenance from MPE's verification layer. The genesis no portal shows.\n\n06\n\n## Location\n\n📍 Borivali  \n19.205193999999999,72.833568000000000\n\n▸ Explore map & Street View — for verified buyers\n\n07\n\n## Promoter & Professionals\n\nShree Siddhivinayak Infrastructure & RealtyNA\n\nRahul KamathiArchitect\n\n08\n\n## Availability & Pricing\n\nTypeCarpetPriceAvail\n\n1 BHK432 ft²₹1.4 Cr—\n\n09\n\n## Construction Progress\n\n56% avg\n\nBasement (if any)100%\n\nExcavation100%\n\nPlinth100%\n\nStilt Floor