/property_residential-projects_1_1_0_0_0.html)  [Uttar Pradesh](https://www.propertycrow.com/uttar-pradesh/property_residential-projects_1_1_0_0_0.html) [Vadodara](https://www.propertycrow.com/vadodara/property_residential-projects_1_1_0_0_0.html) [Valsad](https://www.propertycrow.com/valsad/property_residential-projects_1_1_0_0_0.html) [Varanasi](https://www.propertycrow.com/varanasi/property_residential-projects_1_1_0_0_0.html) [Visakhapatnam](https://www.propertycrow.com/visakhapatnam/property_residential-projects_1_1_0_0_0.html)\n\n## Contact Us\n\nWe'd love to hear from you. Fill in the details below.\n\n✉ [[email protected]](/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection)\n\n### Message Sent!\n\nThank you for reaching out. Our team will get back to you within 24 hours.\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/codename-west-park-phase-1-by-ruparel-realty-in-mumbai","title":"Codename West Park Phase 1 in Kandivali West, Mumbai by Ruparel Realty - RealEstateIndia.Com","raw_content":"![RealEstateIndia.Com - India's Property Portal](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/images/realestateindia-logo.svg)\n![RealEstateIndia.Com](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/images/realestateindia-icon.svg)\n\nSearch from Over 2500 Cities **-**\nAll India\n\nPOPULAR CITIES\n\nOther CITIES\n\nProperty By Locality\n\nProperty By Type\n\nProperty By BHK\n\nProperty By Budget\n\nProperty By Locality\n\nProperty By Type\n\nProperty By BHK\n\nPG in Mumbai\n\nProjects in Mumbai\n\nAgents in Mumbai\n\nFor Owner\n\nFor Agents\n\nServices in Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/images/help-icon.jpg)\n![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/images/login-register-icon.jpg)\n![Codename West Park Phase 1, Mumbai - Luxurious Apartments](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh4/project9464/proj_img-9464_1.jpg)\n\n# Codename West Park Phase 1 Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img1.jpg)\n\nProperty Type  \n\nFlats / Apartments\n\n![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img2.jpg)\n\nConfiguration  \n\n1, 2 BHK\n\n![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img13.jpg)\n\nArea of Flats / Apartments  \n\n667 - 1072 Sq.ft.\n\n![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img3.jpg)\n\nPricing  \n\n63 - 97 Lac\n\n![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img9.jpg)\n\nPossession Status  \n\nOngoing Projects\n\n## Unit Configuration\n\n| Unit Type | Area | Price (in ) | Floor Plan |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | 667 Sq.ft. (Built Up) | 63 Lac |  |\n| 2 BHK+2T | 815 Sq.ft. (Built Up) | 77 Lac |  |\n| 2 BHK+2T | 1072 Sq.ft. (Built Up) | 97 Lac |  |\n\n## About Codename West Park Phase 1\n\nEVERGREEN LIVING, REDEFINING THE WAY OF LIFE\nWelcome to a life that brings the best or both worlds-nature & luxury! Codename West Park is a massive residential development surrounded with green abunde [...read more](javascript:void(0);)\n\n### About Codename West Park Phase 1\n\nAbout Codename West Park Phase 1\n\nEVERGREEN LIVING, REDEFINING THE WAY OF LIFE\n\nWelcome to a life that brings the best or both worlds-nature & luxury! Codename West Park is a massive residential development surrounded with green abundence & litestyle's extravagance. A pre-launch opportunity to grab the finest 1 & 2 BHK residences ensuring the benefits of green living in the most upscale residential address of the Western Suburbs et Kandivali West.\n\nLife meets luxury of nature\n\nExperience life where lifestyle meets the nature & future at one place. Feel the abundance of lush green nature sprawled across acres & acres. Discover the class of living at the impeccable architectural development graced by scintillating views of Marve Beach & verdure. Inhale the fresh air daily while you exhale the breath of satisfaction for a life you have chosen. Find yourself in best of health, soothingly pampered & throughly entertained. Because you have chosen to live evergreen for a lifetime at a thoughtfully planned desination which is a friend of environment as well as the lavish indulgences of modern living.\n\nA LANDMARK DEVELOPMENT WHERE LIFE MEETS LUXURY OF NATURE\n\nStrategically located in Kandivali West, the development hosts lush green nature sprawled across acres & acres. Premium 40 and 30 storey towers offering 1 & 2 BHK eco-friendly apartments with stunning views of Marve Beach with lush green surroundings along with full-fledged podium level Clubhouse with world class amenities and facilities, the upscale address here meets the best of life.\n\nA HAPPENING DESTINATION OF FINEST LIFESTYLE\n\nFinest Location - Strategically located with easy access to infrastructures like Highways, Metro Rail, Railway Stations and other arterial roads\n\nFinest Layouts & Amenities - Acres of green landscapes & open space, world-class clubhouse with best of amenities, Imported marble flooring living, dining & passage area, wooden flooring in bedroom, finest American & German bath ?tments for all comfort & indulgences\n\nFinest Neighbourhood - Prominent healthcare, schools & colleges, infrastructure & entertainment within 3 km radius\n\n## Specifications\n\nFLOORING\nImported marble flooring in living room, dining area & passage\nBEDROOM\nBedrooms with stylish imported wooden flooring & separate wardrobe areas\nKITCHEN\nKitchen with high-grade grani [...read more](javascript:void(0);)\n\n### Specifications\n\nFLOORING\n\nImported marble flooring in living room, dining area & passage\n\nBEDROOM\n\nBedrooms with stylish imported wooden flooring & separate wardrobe areas\n\nKITCHEN\n\nKitchen with high-grade granite platform, stainless steel sink, piped gas connection (on demand) & premium vitrified tiling\n\nTOILET\n\nBathrooms with premium Jaguar CP fittings, European Duravit/Isenberg/Villeroy Bach sanitary ware & designer vitrified tiles\n\n## Amenities\n\n![Club House](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/club-house.jpg)\n\nClub House\n\n![Gymnasium](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/gymnasium.jpg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![Lift](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/lift.jpg)\n\nLift\n\n![Maintenance Staff](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/maintenance-staff.jpg)\n\nMaintenance Staff\n\n![Power Backup](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/power-backup.jpg)\n\nPower Backup\n\n![Park](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/park.jpg)\n\nPark\n\n### Amenities\n\n![Club House](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/club-house.jpg)\n\nClub House\n\n![Gymnasium](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/gymnasium.jpg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![Lift](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/lift.jpg)\n\nLift\n\n![Maintenance Staff](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/maintenance-staff.jpg)\n\nMaintenance Staff\n\n![Power Backup](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/power-backup.jpg)\n\nPower Backup\n\n![Park](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/park.jpg)\n\nPark\n\n![Reserved Parking](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/reserved-parking.jpg)\n\nReserved Parking\n\n![Swimming Pool](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/swimming-pool.jpg)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![Security](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/security.jpg)\n\nSecurity\n\n![Water Storage](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/water-storage.jpg)\n\nWater Storage\n\n## Image Gallery of this Project\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh3/project9464/proj_img-9464_1.jpg)\n\n## Location Map of Codename West Park Phase 1\n\n## About Ruparel Realty\n\n### About Ruparel Realty\n\nAbout Ruparel Realty\n